SUMMARY:PAM CUT x Criterion
DESCRIPTION:Overview\n\n\n\nPAM CUT x Criterion presents a three-day celebration of film throughout the Museum as part of the week-long PAM CUT Cinema Unbound festivities! Activities include the Criterion Mobile Closet\, a live taping of the Criterion Channel series Adventures in Moviegoing with Fred Armisen and Carrie Brownstein\, and a short series of films in celebration of PAM CUT’s Cinema Unbound Wild + Free weekend! Catch Monterey Pop\, Paris Is Burning\, and Something Wild at The Whitsell. \n\n\n\nRelated \n\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Monterey Pop x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 23\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Paris Is Burning x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 24\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Partner events\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Criterion Mobile Closet												\n									\n						\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 29\, 2026 – May 31\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n	